findPart [SimTalk] - ParallelStation
Finds the part with the specified name on the ParallelStation designated by <Path> and returns it.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.findPart(PartType:string) → object
Parameter
The parameter PartType of data type string designates the part type.
Return Value
The return value has the data type object.
Example
var o: object := MyParallelStation.findPart("Container") 
// assigns for example .MUs.Container:1
findPart [SimTalk] - ParallelStation
